	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Wii Nunchuck / Wii extension controller card-edge tongue. 5 gold fingers (2 top, 3 bottom) on 2.0mm pitch. REQUIRES 2.0mm PCB THICKNESS. Geometry derived from the open-source Adafruit Wii Nunchuck Breakout Adapter (PID 4836, CC-BY-SA). Origin = centre of contact field; tongue points -Y. Notch of the Nunchuck plug faces the FRONT (F.Cu) side.")
